{"__formatVersion":2,"__revision":"476eb0b12683eb8f","__entryId":"border-radius","entry":{"sceneUI":["<div style=\"max-width:300px;margin:12px auto 0;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card);position:relative\">\n      <span class=\"radius-sc-chip\" style=\"position:absolute;top:-10px;left:14px\">border-radius: 12px</span>\n      <div style=\"padding:11px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px\"><b style=\"font-size:13px;flex:1\">消息通知</b><span class=\"demo-switch\" style=\"width:38px;height:22px\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked><span class=\"track\"></span></span></div>\n      <div style=\"padding:11px 14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px\"><b style=\"font-size:13px;flex:1\">深色模式</b><span class=\"demo-switch\" style=\"width:38px;height:22px\"><input type=\"checkbox\"><span class=\"track\"></span></span></div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:340px;margin:12px auto 0;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;display:flex;gap:10px;position:relative\">\n      <img src=\"/assets/avatar-fox.png\" style=\"width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;flex:none\" alt=\"\">\n      <span class=\"radius-sc-chip\" style=\"position:absolute;top:-10px;left:16px\">50% 正圆</span>\n      <div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>小狐狸</b> <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">· 2 小时前</span></div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-top:3px\">这篇圆角教程太好懂了，已收藏！</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div>\n      <div style=\"max-width:340px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/photo-cat.png\" style=\"width:52px;height:42px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:8px;flex:none\" alt=\"\">\n        <div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\">\n          <b style=\"font-size:13px\">前端入门训练营</b>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:5px\">\n            <span style=\"background:var(--red-light);color:var(--red);font-size:12px;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:999px\">热卖</span>\n            <span style=\"background:var(--brand-light);color:var(--brand);font-size:12px;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:999px\">上新</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" style=\"border-radius:999px;padding:5px 12px;font-size:12px\">＋ 关注</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"radius-sc-note\"><b style=\"color:var(--brand)\">border-radius: 999px</b> 是让此示例达到胶囊轮廓的 CSS 写法，不是所有组件的固定值</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:340px;margin:12px auto 0;position:relative\">\n      <span class=\"radius-sc-chip\" style=\"position:absolute;top:-10px;left:8px\">同角色沿用同一圆角 token</span>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px\">\n        <input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"flex:1;min-width:0;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px\" value=\"圆角按钮怎么做\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"border-radius:8px;padding:8px 16px;font-size:12px\">搜索</button>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px\">\n        <span class=\"demo-tag gray\" style=\"border-radius:8px\">border-radius</span>\n        <span class=\"demo-tag gray\" style=\"border-radius:8px\">box-shadow</span>\n        <span class=\"demo-tag gray\" style=\"border-radius:8px\">flex 布局</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"sceneUI_en":["<div style=\"max-width:300px;margin:12px auto 0;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card);position:relative\">\n      <span class=\"radius-sc-chip\" style=\"position:absolute;top:-10px;left:14px\">border-radius: 12px</span>\n      <div style=\"padding:11px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px\"><b style=\"font-size:13px;flex:1\">Message notification</b><span class=\"demo-switch\" style=\"width:38px;height:22px\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked><span class=\"track\"></span></span></div>\n      <div style=\"padding:11px 14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px\"><b style=\"font-size:13px;flex:1\">Dark mode</b><span class=\"demo-switch\" style=\"width:38px;height:22px\"><input type=\"checkbox\"><span class=\"track\"></span></span></div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:340px;margin:12px auto 0;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;display:flex;gap:10px;position:relative\">\n      <img src=\"/assets/avatar-fox.png\" style=\"width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;flex:none\" alt=\"\">\n      <span class=\"radius-sc-chip\" style=\"position:absolute;top:-10px;left:16px\">50% perfect circle</span>\n      <div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Little Fox</b> <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">· 2 hours ago</span></div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-top:3px\">This rounded corner tutorial is so easy to understand, I have saved it! </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div>\n      <div style=\"max-width:340px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/photo-cat.png\" style=\"width:52px;height:42px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:8px;flex:none\" alt=\"\">\n        <div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\">\n          <b style=\"font-size:13px\">Front-end entry training camp</b>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:5px\">\n            <span style=\"background:var(--red-light);color:var(--red);font-size:12px;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:999px\">Hot Sale</span>\n            <span style=\"background:var(--brand-light);color:var(--brand);font-size:12px;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:999px\">New</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" style=\"border-radius:999px;padding:5px 12px;font-size:12px\">+ Follow</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"radius-sc-note\"><b style=\"color:var(--brand)\">border-radius: 999px</b> is the CSS writing method that allows this example to achieve a capsule outline, and is not a fixed value for all components</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:340px;margin:12px auto 0;position:relative\">\n      <span class=\"radius-sc-chip\" style=\"position:absolute;top:-10px;left:8px\">Controls with the same visual role use the same radius token</span>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px\">\n        <input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"flex:1;min-width:0;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px\" value=\"How to make rounded buttons\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"border-radius:8px;padding:8px 16px;font-size:12px\">Search</button>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px\">\n        <span class=\"demo-tag gray\" style=\"border-radius:8px\">border-radius</span>\n        <span class=\"demo-tag gray\" style=\"border-radius:8px\">box-shadow</span>\n        <span class=\"demo-tag gray\" style=\"border-radius:8px\">flex layout</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"anatomy":{"demo":"<span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"radius\"><span class=\"radius-anat-outer\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"border\"><span class=\"radius-anat-box\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"content\"><span class=\"radius-anat-content\">内容</span></span></span></span></span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"radius\"><span class=\"radius-anat-outer\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"border\"><span class=\"radius-anat-box\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"content\"><span class=\"radius-anat-content\">Content</span></span></span></span></span></span>","parts":[{"key":"radius","cn":"圆角半径","en":"Radius","desc":"角的圆弧大小，四个角可分别设","desc_en":"The arc size of the corners, the four corners can be set separately"},{"key":"border","cn":"边框","en":"Border","desc":"圆角沿着边框的弧线走","desc_en":"The rounded corners follow the arc of the border"},{"key":"content","cn":"内容","en":"Content","desc":"默认不被圆角裁剪，除非 overflow: hidden","desc_en":"Not clipped by rounded corners by default unless overflow: hidden"}]},"variants":[{"cn":"较小半径","en":"Small","demo":"<span class=\"radius-v\" style=\"border-radius:4px\"></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"radius-v\" style=\"border-radius:4px\"></span>","when":"希望保留较清楚边缘感时；按组件尺寸选择","when_en":"When you want to retain a clearer edge; select according to component size"},{"cn":"中等半径","en":"Medium","demo":"<span class=\"radius-v\" style=\"border-radius:8px\"></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"radius-v\" style=\"border-radius:8px\"></span>","when":"需要在边缘感和柔和轮廓间平衡时","when_en":"When a balance between edge and soft contours is required"},{"cn":"较大半径","en":"Large","demo":"<span class=\"radius-v\" style=\"border-radius:16px\"></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"radius-v\" style=\"border-radius:16px\"></span>","when":"需要更明显圆弧时；先检查内容空间和嵌套关系","when_en":"When you need a more obvious arc; first check the content space and nesting relationship"},{"cn":"圆形","en":"Circle","demo":"<span class=\"radius-v\" style=\"width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%\"></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"radius-v\" style=\"width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%\"></span>","when":"正方形头像、状态点或圆形图标容器","when_en":"Square avatar, status point or round icon container"},{"cn":"胶囊","en":"Pill","demo":"<span class=\"radius-v\" style=\"width:48px;border-radius:999px\"></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"radius-v\" style=\"width:48px;border-radius:999px\"></span>","when":"长条标签或按钮需要两端完整圆弧时","when_en":"When long labels or buttons require complete arcs at both ends"}],"use":[{"t":"相同角色的元素<b>圆角规则一致</b>；{c:card}、{c:input} 角色不同，不必强行使用同一数值","m":"radius-card"},{"t":"{c:avatar} 可用 <b>border-radius: 50%</b>：正方形会形成正圆","m":"radius-avatar"},{"t":"{c:tag} 或胶囊按钮的<b>圆角至少达到高度的一半</b>；足够大的固定值是实现手段，不是语义规则","m":"radius-pill"},{"t":"圆角可<b>分档管理</b>：档位数量和数值由组件尺寸、密度与品牌系统决定","m":"radius-scale"}],"dont":[{"t":"<b>无语义地混用多种圆角</b>，会削弱组件之间的一致性","m":"radius-mess","bad":true},{"t":"给长方形写 50%：得到的是<b>椭圆不是胶囊</b>","m":"radius-ellipse","bad":true},{"t":"容器有圆角但<b>子内容仍超出边界</b>：需要裁切时使用 overflow: hidden","m":"radius-clip","bad":true},{"t":"四角使用<b>无规则的不同半径</b>，会让轮廓缺乏一致性","m":"radius-random-corners","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"同一网站的按钮、输入框和卡片出现了十几种圆角数值，同类组件看起来也不一致。怎样整理？","options":[{"id":"role-based-radius-tokens","label":"按组件角色建立少量圆角档位，并让同类元素复用同一规则","feedback":"角色化档位减少任意数值，同类组件一致，不同角色仍可根据尺寸保持区分。","correct":true},{"id":"unique-radius-per-component","label":"为每个组件保留独立圆角，只要单独看起来协调即可","feedback":"局部都合理不代表系统一致，新增组件还会继续产生难以维护的数值。","correct":false},{"id":"fifty-percent-everywhere","label":"统一给所有按钮、输入框和卡片设置 50% 圆角","feedback":"50% 会让长方形形成椭圆或过度圆化，不能作为所有组件的通用档位。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"One site uses more than ten radius values across buttons, inputs, and cards, and peers do not match. How should it be organized?","options":[{"id":"role-based-radius-tokens","label":"Create a small set of role-based radius tokens and reuse one rule for peer components","feedback":"Role tokens remove arbitrary values, align peers, and still let different component sizes remain distinct.","correct":true},{"id":"unique-radius-per-component","label":"Keep a unique radius for every component as long as each one looks balanced alone","feedback":"Local balance does not create system consistency, and every new component adds another value to maintain.","correct":false},{"id":"fifty-percent-everywhere","label":"Set buttons, inputs, and cards all to a 50% radius","feedback":"Fifty percent turns rectangles into ellipses or excessive rounding and cannot serve every role.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"请盘点现有 border-radius，收敛成少量按角色命名的 token，让同类按钮、输入框和卡片保持一致。胶囊和圆形只用于明确角色；用不同尺寸组件检查比例，并删除没有归属的零散数值。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Audit current border-radius values and consolidate them into a small role-based token set for peer buttons, inputs, and cards. Reserve pills and circles for explicit roles, test varied sizes, and remove unassigned one-off values."}},"references":[{"title":"border-radius 属性","source":"MDN","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/border-radius","title_en":"border-radius"}],"scenes":["卡片与面板","圆形头像","胶囊标签","输入框与按钮"],"en":{"use":[{"t":"Soften controls and cards","m":"radius-card"},{"t":"Create circular avatars","m":"radius-avatar"},{"t":"Build pills or tags","m":"radius-pill"},{"t":"Keep a product's corner language consistent","m":"radius-scale"}],"dont":[{"t":"Choose a different radius for every component","m":"radius-mess","bad":true},{"t":"Round nested boxes so much that their edges clash","m":"radius-ellipse","bad":true},{"t":"Use a pill shape for long, multiline content","m":"radius-clip","bad":true},{"t":"Assume more rounding always feels friendlier","m":"radius-random-corners","bad":true}],"scenes":["Button corners","Card surface","Avatar","Tag"],"sceneUI":["<div style=\"max-width:300px;margin:12px auto 0;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card);position:relative\">\n      <span class=\"radius-sc-chip\" style=\"position:absolute;top:-10px;left:14px\">border-radius: 12px</span>\n      <div style=\"padding:11px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px\"><b style=\"font-size:13px;flex:1\">Message notification</b><span class=\"demo-switch\" style=\"width:38px;height:22px\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked><span class=\"track\"></span></span></div>\n      <div style=\"padding:11px 14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px\"><b style=\"font-size:13px;flex:1\">Dark mode</b><span class=\"demo-switch\" style=\"width:38px;height:22px\"><input type=\"checkbox\"><span class=\"track\"></span></span></div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:340px;margin:12px auto 0;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;display:flex;gap:10px;position:relative\">\n      <img src=\"/assets/avatar-fox.png\" style=\"width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;flex:none\" alt=\"\">\n      <span class=\"radius-sc-chip\" style=\"position:absolute;top:-10px;left:16px\">50% perfect circle</span>\n      <div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Little Fox</b> <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">· 2 hours ago</span></div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-top:3px\">This rounded corner tutorial is so easy to understand, I have saved it! </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div>\n      <div style=\"max-width:340px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/photo-cat.png\" style=\"width:52px;height:42px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:8px;flex:none\" alt=\"\">\n        <div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\">\n          <b style=\"font-size:13px\">Front-end entry training camp</b>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:5px\">\n            <span style=\"background:var(--red-light);color:var(--red);font-size:12px;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:999px\">Hot Sale</span>\n            <span style=\"background:var(--brand-light);color:var(--brand);font-size:12px;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:999px\">New</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" style=\"border-radius:999px;padding:5px 12px;font-size:12px\">+ Follow</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"radius-sc-note\"><b style=\"color:var(--brand)\">border-radius: 999px</b> is the CSS writing method that allows this example to achieve a capsule outline, and is not a fixed value for all components</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:340px;margin:12px auto 0;position:relative\">\n      <span class=\"radius-sc-chip\" style=\"position:absolute;top:-10px;left:8px\">Controls with the same visual role use the same radius token</span>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px\">\n        <input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"flex:1;min-width:0;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px\" value=\"How to make rounded buttons\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"border-radius:8px;padding:8px 16px;font-size:12px\">Search</button>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px\">\n        <span class=\"demo-tag gray\" style=\"border-radius:8px\">border-radius</span>\n        <span class=\"demo-tag gray\" style=\"border-radius:8px\">box-shadow</span>\n        <span class=\"demo-tag gray\" style=\"border-radius:8px\">flex layout</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"variants":[{"demo":"<span class=\"radius-v\" style=\"border-radius:4px\"></span>","when":"When you want to retain a clearer edge; select according to component size"},{"demo":"<span class=\"radius-v\" style=\"border-radius:8px\"></span>","when":"When a balance between edge and soft contours is required"},{"demo":"<span class=\"radius-v\" style=\"border-radius:16px\"></span>","when":"When you need a more obvious arc; first check the content space and nesting relationship"},{"demo":"<span class=\"radius-v\" style=\"width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%\"></span>","when":"Square avatar, status point or round icon container"},{"demo":"<span class=\"radius-v\" style=\"width:48px;border-radius:999px\"></span>","when":"When long labels or buttons require complete arcs at both ends"}]},"usageMocks":{"radius-card":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span class=\"mk-input\" style=\"width:100%;border-radius:8px\">输入控件：control token</span><span style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:5px 8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">内容容器：surface token</span></div>","radius-avatar":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--brand),#722ed1);color:#fff;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px\">林</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">正方形 + 50% = 正圆头像</span></div>","radius-pill":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-tag blue\" style=\"border-radius:999px;padding:3px 12px\">胶囊标签</span><span class=\"mk-btn outline\" style=\"border-radius:999px\">胶囊按钮</span></div>","radius-scale":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:20px;height:20px;background:var(--brand-light);border:1px solid var(--brand);border-radius:3px\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">小档</span><span style=\"width:20px;height:20px;background:var(--brand-light);border:1px solid var(--brand);border-radius:7px\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">中档</span><span style=\"width:20px;height:20px;background:var(--brand-light);border:1px solid var(--brand);border-radius:15px\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">大档</span></div>","radius-mess":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:28px;height:22px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px\"></span><span style=\"width:28px;height:22px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:11px\"></span><span style=\"width:28px;height:22px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px\"></span><span style=\"width:28px;height:22px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:18px\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">多个无语义档位混用，组件关系不一致</span>","radius-ellipse":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:52px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--red-light);border:1px solid var(--red)\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">长方形 + 50% = 椭圆，不是胶囊</span></div>","radius-clip":"<span style=\"display:inline-block;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--border)\"><span style=\"display:block;width:52px;height:30px;background:var(--brand-light)\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);max-width:130px\">容器有圆角，但子内容仍超出圆角边界</span>","radius-random-corners":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:26px;height:22px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px 2px 8px 0\"></span><span style=\"width:26px;height:22px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:0 12px 3px 9px\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">各角半径没有明确规则，组件外观难以保持一致</span>"}}}